        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/29/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:07dc7bd58adcfa92c5f8cf70",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我们决定不在学校内举办比赛，转而借用了自由竞技场的赛道。\r\n那边没人会对跑道进行整备，只有更强的力量才能应对那样的草地。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f258010af6faeab5f408cd4074734b4ae903055d2fd3965eee3431578d6037a5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
