    {
      "uid": "zhcn:df975064580ef808f05ab5ff",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "——这就是一度与世界交锋的神鹰！看看她振翅高飞的模样吧！\r\n多么完美的胜利！果然除她以外再无别人能与世界相争！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4c6dc0517a938d2f3050c7c5436a6cbf7dd74a02c2a30fd068b6421f5e23829c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
