    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b7c296a6bf26ce0401d26774",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "神鹰",
      "source_fingerprint": "795f13602f1e9cddca3fec6d57b66ab4924d833a2a706e841577ffebe02c9437",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1049/storytimeline_041049004.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        34,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/34/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cbe9ba4dd178847b52860209",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "哈啊、哈啊……天狼星前辈也真爱捉弄人呀。小鹰明白的。\r\n虽然小鹰才刚刚结束休养，但中山前辈还尚是雏鸟、未来可期、成长在望。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2bf4600d2d5522f1c2d0a2cd45fad7edb687c8e472a4f4203b3e012a7e574dab",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1049/storytimeline_041049004.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        34,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/34/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:59705e4369db109cbcd36386",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "神鹰",
      "source_fingerprint": "795f13602f1e9cddca3fec6d57b66ab4924d833a2a706e841577ffebe02c9437",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1049/storytimeline_041049004.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        35,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/35/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eb959af781d93920007acf63",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "要是仅仅因为这点程度的胜利就沾沾自喜，\r\n那下次只能眼睁睁看着中山前辈飞往更高处了。\r\n不过，下次获胜的人与先一步夺得世界的人——都一定会是小鹰！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e337054483ec030b64148860eaaec6419513617525aef961ccbff9a56bb4fba3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1049/storytimeline_041049004.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        35,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/35/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:56343da1880f14cd62125ad3",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "天狼星象征",
      "source_fingerprint": "6ec317440b52f89fbdfad76110a7afc3ac55b01c91d67997968e5ba969bc9ea2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
