      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……喂喂，这可不是一个在找继承人的家伙该有的态度啊。\r\n啊哈哈哈哈……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "60613a39703decf442828d92144db5d9b60705a85a24ddde01983a12b7b1a5f6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
