    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a89bfe3e5dd3bff827ea03d6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "行吧，没被扯掉翅膀的神鹰可要先一步启航了哦！\r\n要真想去实现巴黎之梦的话，就赶紧磨锐牙齿吧，中山！\r\n——世界可不会停下来等你哦？",
      "source_fingerprint": "f351c91f13f20be50243ab9c080ddbfd701a8541cd46fd24487d7879ea980b08",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
