      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1049/storytimeline_041049004.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2c4fbab02ce34fbc2592b325",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这天，我正在训练员室完成一些例行工作时，\r\n中山的班主任找上了门来。",
      "source_fingerprint": "513cbf9158024ffedef3689289328844ade586b40149534504526171870d1786",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1049/storytimeline_041049005.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c4c9e7b7e3d47c27ac59d286",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "中山的班主任",
      "source_fingerprint": "34fe7460a370b52499f63d643fb695c70364865d85c1b840f4f1def82a69a505",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1049/storytimeline_041049005.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:055d567161990363ff540d59",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "是吗……中山同学没来这里呀。\r\n不好意思，打扰您工作了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "34528c707fa91e3c992c59dc99535444f4f6a2b6edcf880173751c909161a823",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1049/storytimeline_041049005.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eeb12e5be8680a66baf01b6d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "（不对，她应该不会……）",
      "source_fingerprint": "c47e1a90c6869174950a474a3532b768403dfa6154f0cc2daf0a9ee074d3424d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1049/storytimeline_041049005.json",
      "json_path": [
