      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/13/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:30a85dc150e611bf658b384f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我将事情和盘托出。\r\n一开始只是为了让她交作业才出门找她，然后——",
      "source_fingerprint": "92d636209d87c3b02516c3a141f27f6c164d50d7d61109980c63c0f68b6e4202",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1049/storytimeline_041049005.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        14,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/14/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fcd44ea1ae9888b76e64126c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "听说她被警察约谈、在赌局里出千——学园内外，\r\n关于她的流言已经开始满天飞了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "94d1ce0d90c95d1d56e43179474c24dd74bd4a260315e8c12b9640ad0bda2467",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
