      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "哈哈哈哈……\r\n不知不觉间，那些怪话都已经发展成这样了啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c1f6bd855621db0d47e90d701b3837fa493cb93a529f5451fde0df363d2f49a6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
