    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0c33a89a98151de58e2c9b76",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "都是鬼扯啦。出千后赢到手软？\r\n那种事情太无聊啦，根本没法让人浑身发麻。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b080d75f9ea7ebab3f7a5e776bb613146dda6e19b6535940c86f6e125a4e9998",
